WEBVTT

00:00:05.830 --> 00:00:10.960
The first familiar I ever summoned was a gigantic egg.

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:19.830
Only dragons had huge eggs,
and though it wouldn't be strong right away,

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:24.630
if I took care of it and incubated it,
I'd get myself a powerful dragon familiar.

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:26.630
Just you wait.

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:30.130
Whoa, what a huge egg!

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:34.750
Chris!

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:41.580
That's cool! Is that your familiar?
It's way bigger than mine!

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:43.540
Oh, uh, yeah!

00:00:43.790 --> 00:00:47.080
I can't believe the supergenius Chris
is actually talking to me!

00:00:53.880 --> 00:00:55.920
I can't wait till it hatches!

00:00:57.250 --> 00:00:59.540
I bet it'll be gigantic and super cool!

00:01:03.210 --> 00:01:08.000
Y-yeah, I'm gonna incubate it so it'll be real big and cool!

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:12.330
That was how I got to know her.

00:01:32.420 --> 00:01:35.380
Shiro ka kuro kongaragatte gray

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:38.670
Itsudatte aimai na mama de

00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:44.630
Tayorinaku aruku tonari de hohoenderu kimi

00:01:45.130 --> 00:01:48.080
Akogare wa tashika da toshite

00:01:48.170 --> 00:01:51.380
Hateshinaku tooku mabushii

00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:57.210
Chippokena kono genjou Abracada-Boo mahou kakete yo

00:01:57.210 --> 00:02:03.250
Kimi no hitomi no yami ni kakushita

00:02:03.500 --> 00:02:10.170
Samishisa wa yasashii uta de dakishimeteitai no ni

00:02:11.290 --> 00:02:14.790
Sekaijuu ga uso datte sawagihajimetatte

00:02:14.790 --> 00:02:17.460
Kimi ga kimi naraba

00:02:17.460 --> 00:02:23.670
Kirameku kaze o makiokoshi shinjitsu o sakebu

00:02:23.790 --> 00:02:27.420
Sekaijuu ga tsumi datte togameta toshitatte

00:02:27.420 --> 00:02:30.250
Tatta hitori demo

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:33.330
Kimi o rikai shi tsuzuketai

00:02:33.330 --> 00:02:38.670
I'm on your side mamotte ageru

00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:47.880
<b>RAMPAGE</b>

00:03:05.130 --> 00:03:09.330
What should we make for dinner? Lettuce is on sale…

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:11.920
Alto! Let's get some dessert! C'mon!

00:03:15.080 --> 00:03:19.960
You shouldn't live off just dessert.
You need to eat a balanced diet.

00:03:19.960 --> 00:03:23.210
Don't you worry! I'm eating other food, too!

00:03:28.210 --> 00:03:32.460
No! We're short on money this month,
so no snacks or desserts!

00:03:32.670 --> 00:03:34.080
Gaaah!

00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:41.500
C'mon, let's go. I'll buy you
some desserts some other time.

00:03:48.250 --> 00:03:51.040
Roast beef is yummy too, you know!

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:51.750
Nuh-uh!

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:56.830
Vermeil can be so childish sometimes.

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:01.960
Will you clean your plate tonight?

00:04:01.960 --> 00:04:02.920
Uh-huh.

00:04:03.540 --> 00:04:05.500
And will you clean the bathroom?

00:04:07.630 --> 00:04:08.420
Uh-huh.

00:04:11.380 --> 00:04:14.170
Then all right. Just one, now.

00:04:14.960 --> 00:04:17.000
But just this one, all right?

00:04:17.460 --> 00:04:18.500
I love you!

00:04:26.210 --> 00:04:26.710
C'mere.

00:04:35.380 --> 00:04:37.880
H-hey, hold on, Vermeil!

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:42.250
What? What's wrong? I'm not even draining your mana.

00:04:42.250 --> 00:04:44.210
Th-that's not the issue here…

00:04:45.080 --> 00:04:49.210
You said if you love someone,
you can kiss them whenever you want, right?

00:04:49.210 --> 00:04:50.880
I-I didn't say that!

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:55.330
L-look, we're out in public right now!

00:04:55.670 --> 00:04:56.540
Oh!

00:04:56.920 --> 00:04:58.420
I see.

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:02.130
If you want me to drain your mana,

00:05:03.790 --> 00:05:06.170
you could just ask.

00:05:07.170 --> 00:05:07.750
Ve-

00:05:17.380 --> 00:05:20.130
Vermeil…

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:23.210
Cut it out!

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:24.540
There you are!

00:05:28.830 --> 00:05:30.790
I'm so glad I found you!

00:05:33.790 --> 00:05:35.670
Y-you gotta help…

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:39.170
My bro needs help!

00:05:51.130 --> 00:05:56.880
Damn, that's a nice look for you, Captain Chris.

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:02.130
Rex!

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:05.880
Funny how things work out.

00:06:06.330 --> 00:06:11.710
You always seemed so far away,
but now you're on the floor beneath me.

00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:16.130
Rex, you bastard…

00:06:17.580 --> 00:06:19.460
What the hell did you do?!

00:06:35.130 --> 00:06:38.630
What'd I do? I dunno.

00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:47.080
And I don't care.

00:07:02.460 --> 00:07:05.380
Man, this is weird.

00:07:08.080 --> 00:07:13.290
I thought this'd make me feel better,
but ever since I started…

00:07:13.880 --> 00:07:16.920
I'm just getting more and more pissed off!

00:07:32.580 --> 00:07:35.920
C'mon! Fight back already!

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:41.500
Is that all the Gold Square Captain
of the Dragonriders has to dish out?!

00:07:44.630 --> 00:07:45.830
Get the hell up!

00:07:47.750 --> 00:07:51.750
I know that's not all you got!

00:07:52.920 --> 00:07:54.960
R-Rex…

00:07:56.710 --> 00:07:57.460
Stop…

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:00.830
Rex!

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:04.420
Bro!

00:08:05.170 --> 00:08:06.420
You guys?

00:08:08.630 --> 00:08:10.790
Perfect timing.

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:16.710
I gotta pay you back for what you did for me.
You just saved me time looking for you.

00:08:17.080 --> 00:08:18.580
C-Chris!

00:08:18.750 --> 00:08:19.790
Bro…

00:08:20.790 --> 00:08:21.960
No…

00:08:23.750 --> 00:08:26.290
Second-year, Alto…

00:08:28.080 --> 00:08:29.290
Run.

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:37.920
Did you do this to Chris, Rex?

00:08:39.960 --> 00:08:44.460
It was me, duh! You see anyone else here?

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:47.750
All right, then.

00:08:53.040 --> 00:08:58.040
Oh, hell no, I hate that look!

00:09:01.080 --> 00:09:01.920
His mana…

00:09:02.290 --> 00:09:04.710
I hate her, I hate you!

00:09:05.330 --> 00:09:07.830
I hate, hate...

00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:12.380
HATE everyone!

00:09:17.040 --> 00:09:20.250
I feel great! Better than great!

00:09:20.420 --> 00:09:22.670
And if I get rid of you, I'll…

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:30.000
That's enough!

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:36.710
Summon!

00:09:55.880 --> 00:10:00.380
<b>Judgment</b>

00:09:56.920 --> 00:10:00.380
<b>Sword</b>

00:09:58.460 --> 00:09:59.710
Judgment Sword.

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:09.540
Rex Forward.

00:10:17.920 --> 00:10:21.790
I hereby punish you in the name of absolute justice.

00:10:20.250 --> 00:10:23.540
<b>ORTIGIA ACADEMY</b>

00:10:20.250 --> 00:10:23.540
<b>STUDENT COUNCIL PRESIDENT,</b>

00:10:20.250 --> 00:10:23.540
<b>ELENA KIMBERLIGHT</b>

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:28.170
Madam President…

00:10:28.330 --> 00:10:29.500
Chris!

00:10:31.130 --> 00:10:32.750
Are you all right, Chris?

00:10:34.920 --> 00:10:36.330
You're wounded…

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:40.790
And after fighting such a lowly opponent?

00:10:41.040 --> 00:10:43.130
You should be ashamed of yourself.

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:46.630
Y-you don't have to put her down…

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:48.290
Wait.

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:53.040
Don't just barge in…

00:10:53.460 --> 00:10:56.790
…when it ain't your fight!

00:10:58.500 --> 00:11:01.830
I-I'm still…

00:11:04.630 --> 00:11:05.080
Rex…

00:11:05.080 --> 00:11:05.960
Rex!

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:08.790
Rex! C'mon, Rex!

00:11:11.380 --> 00:11:12.500
Rex!

00:11:23.630 --> 00:11:24.460
You.

00:11:28.420 --> 00:11:34.250
Do you have any knowledge as to what that power was?

00:11:38.790 --> 00:11:39.880
No idea.

00:11:56.210 --> 00:12:00.250
It's been three days since the incident,
which brought the total number of victims to five.

00:12:01.580 --> 00:12:07.630
We did learn one thing from
the Rex Forward incident: someone is behind this.

00:12:08.210 --> 00:12:10.830
But we don't know if it's caused by a drug or black magic,

00:12:11.170 --> 00:12:14.420
so we can't guarantee we'll be able to help the afflicted.

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:17.380
This incident is-

00:12:19.830 --> 00:12:21.920
Hey! This discussion isn't over!

00:12:31.210 --> 00:12:32.460
I don't get her.

00:12:33.130 --> 00:12:35.750
Forward was the man she punished before, yes?

00:12:37.170 --> 00:12:41.210
She enjoys being rough with her toys...

00:12:44.040 --> 00:12:47.670
...but dislikes when others mistreat what is hers.

00:12:50.130 --> 00:12:53.460
<b>BRONZE SQUARE</b>

00:12:50.130 --> 00:12:53.460
<b>EXAM NOTICE</b>

00:12:53.710 --> 00:12:57.420
Oh, boy! It's nearly time
for the Bronze Certification Exam!

00:12:57.630 --> 00:12:59.880
Y-yeah, that's right.

00:13:02.960 --> 00:13:05.040
What's got you all distracted?

00:13:05.040 --> 00:13:05.670
Ow!

00:13:06.380 --> 00:13:12.080
I know you're still thinking about what happened,
but you need to focus on the road ahead!

00:13:13.170 --> 00:13:15.920
What will happen if you fail the Bronze exam now?

00:13:16.460 --> 00:13:21.500
That dinosaur freak will get all worked up
about it being "his fault"!

00:13:22.920 --> 00:13:24.580
H-he would.

00:13:24.750 --> 00:13:28.330
I know! So you need to pass it on your first try!

00:13:29.960 --> 00:13:35.880
Then, when he wakes up,
you can say you're on his level now!

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:39.130
<b>Lilia!</b>

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:38.630
That's kinda rude...

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:40.290
Alto!

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:42.830
What's wrong?

00:13:42.830 --> 00:13:43.670
Nothing.

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:47.630
I'm a little tired. Can I go back to our room to rest?

00:13:48.040 --> 00:13:52.250
Huh? Are you all right? If you're not feeling well,
then I can come too…

00:13:52.250 --> 00:13:57.710
No, it's all right. Your exam is coming up,
and you gotta go to the library to study, right?

00:14:07.380 --> 00:14:10.710
That was strange. She NEVER leaves you alone.

00:14:11.330 --> 00:14:14.460
I-I hope Vermeil is okay.

00:14:14.710 --> 00:14:18.420
She's not a child.
She can walk back to the dorm by herself.

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:21.460
No, that's not what I meant…

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:27.630
Vermeil's just been acting a little weird
ever since the thing with Rex.

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:30.170
Enough about her!

00:14:30.630 --> 00:14:33.670
This is our one chance to hang out alone together!

00:14:33.670 --> 00:14:41.000
L-let's study in my room- no, a study
room! I-i-it'll be eaiser to focus there!

00:14:42.540 --> 00:14:44.960
Oh, sure. Whatever works.

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:55.000
I knew I recognized that power...

00:15:07.750 --> 00:15:10.080
Oh, I know you.

00:15:15.670 --> 00:15:18.670
So do I. You're Alto's teacher.

00:15:19.330 --> 00:15:22.580
Professor Obsidian. I teach magic history.

00:15:23.500 --> 00:15:25.880
Is Alto not with you today?

00:15:26.710 --> 00:15:30.580
I think this is the first time we've spoken.

00:15:31.710 --> 00:15:34.880
Even the teachers are talking about you…

00:15:34.880 --> 00:15:36.080
Hey, Professor.

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:41.330
You did it, right?

00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:50.250
I can't say I understand. What are you inferring I did?

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:56.130
C'mon, you don't need to bluff.
I've been onto you for a while.

00:15:56.750 --> 00:15:59.630
I can smell the low-tier clinging to you.

00:16:00.630 --> 00:16:02.130
Low-tier what?

00:16:03.000 --> 00:16:06.880
What you're trying to do with them
is none of my business,

00:16:09.540 --> 00:16:10.880
but I recommend you stop.

00:16:13.130 --> 00:16:15.920
It's too much power for a human to handle.

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:22.540
Are you going to tell him about me?

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:25.290
I don't care enough to.

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:31.580
I told you it's none of my business.
I just wanted to warn you.

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:34.130
If you want to do it, then fine, do it.

00:16:34.830 --> 00:16:35.830
But…

00:16:38.080 --> 00:16:43.500
You lay a finger on Alto,
and I'll rip you and your soul to shreds.

00:16:50.130 --> 00:16:51.540
I see!

00:16:52.540 --> 00:16:54.130
You're the real thing.

00:16:55.580 --> 00:17:01.710
True, from your point of view, mine's quite low-tier.

00:17:01.960 --> 00:17:04.790
Likely not even worth your time.

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:07.540
If you understand, then you should stop.

00:17:08.080 --> 00:17:11.710
Nothing good will come out of your pursuit.

00:17:19.250 --> 00:17:20.170
Oh, no...

00:17:21.790 --> 00:17:24.290
...low-tier is well worth it.

00:17:26.290 --> 00:17:29.330
Because now, I can obtain the real thing.

00:17:34.080 --> 00:17:35.290
You bastard, what did you do?!

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:43.040
It's...

00:17:47.460 --> 00:17:49.250
You told me I should do as I wish.

00:17:50.210 --> 00:17:55.130
So I'm merely following your suggestion.

00:18:04.920 --> 00:18:09.540
S-see? I-if you use this here, you get this!

00:18:11.130 --> 00:18:14.540
I get it! Calm down, Lilia!

00:18:14.540 --> 00:18:15.750
Why should I calm down?!

00:18:15.750 --> 00:18:16.380
Huh?

00:18:16.960 --> 00:18:19.250
You don't have that many days till the exam!

00:18:19.460 --> 00:18:22.210
C'mon, now, start undressing, too!

00:18:22.500 --> 00:18:23.250
Why?

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:31.250
Lilia, could you please not…

00:18:33.420 --> 00:18:35.960
Wh-what?! Are you all right?!

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:39.080
Y-yeah, but my right hand just started…

00:18:40.540 --> 00:18:42.040
Wait, what…?

00:18:46.830 --> 00:18:47.420
Hey!

00:18:48.960 --> 00:18:50.500
What is it now?!

00:18:54.420 --> 00:18:55.630
Vermeil?

00:19:18.960 --> 00:19:20.170
There, there…

00:19:24.790 --> 00:19:27.040
What is this mana?!

00:19:34.290 --> 00:19:35.130
Huh?

00:19:36.750 --> 00:19:38.670
N-no…

00:19:43.790 --> 00:19:44.830
Hold on, Alto!

00:19:54.130 --> 00:19:55.290
That mana…

00:20:23.500 --> 00:20:24.380
What are you?

00:20:25.040 --> 00:20:26.540
I should have expected that.

00:20:27.920 --> 00:20:33.420
But small as it may be,
it's still quite necessary for our success.

00:20:49.130 --> 00:20:51.790
I cannot let you pass.

00:21:23.250 --> 00:21:26.290
I've... I've done it. I've done it!

00:21:26.630 --> 00:21:29.330
Look at her! This is my…

00:21:39.420 --> 00:21:40.080
Wha-?

00:21:40.460 --> 00:21:42.130
Just with one swing of her arm…

00:21:46.630 --> 00:21:49.580
So this is how powerful the real thing can be…

00:22:08.000 --> 00:22:09.210
Vermeil!

00:22:15.630 --> 00:22:22.580
Does it get easier with time for the immortal?

00:22:26.000 --> 00:22:33.290
If I was born normal, if I become normal, can I stay close?

00:22:33.880 --> 00:22:38.710
With the children, we link our arms

00:22:39.920 --> 00:22:43.920
Make a circle and sing a song

00:22:44.250 --> 00:22:50.670
Knowing there was no chair for me all along

00:22:50.880 --> 00:22:55.960
You locked me into the dark, I'm your preserved flower

00:22:55.960 --> 00:22:59.630
The world is too slow to understand

00:22:59.630 --> 00:23:03.210
Not all blossoms spark, And spikes may be sharp

00:23:03.330 --> 00:23:07.750
They only want to see the beautiful parts

00:23:07.750 --> 00:23:11.130
Sitting in a shower of scarlet rain

00:23:11.130 --> 00:23:15.460
It all used to be ours, I'm counting the hours

00:23:15.460 --> 00:23:18.920
Hours that stood between us like a river

00:23:18.920 --> 00:23:20.920
Once I crawled through the water

00:23:20.920 --> 00:23:26.460
All I ever knew have become distant past
